'''''Rivers Run Without Return''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Farewell, Penacony]].

==Steps==
# Talk to Siobhan and prepare a drink
# (Optional) Chat with your fellow members of the Crew
# Say goodbye to Siobhan and prepare to board

