==Dialogue==
{{Stub Dialogue}}
:'''Dan Heng:''' The Alfalfa Family had a meeting with the IPC?
:'''Welt:''' I got this information from a message sent by that {{Rubi|IPC ambassador|Aventurine}}. He said it was to "return the favor."
:'''Welt:''' It's not hard to imagine. Penacony today is pretty much like the frontier prison it once was, with external forces casting greedy eyes and the undercurrent of Order lurking within.
:'''Welt:''' Instead of falling into a situation where they are plagued by both external and internal threats, Penacony would rather take a step back and invite the IPC to negotiate at the table, ostensibly to cooperate, but in reality, to secure more opportunities for their own survival.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Well, no wonder they sought the mediation from the Astral Express. In your opinion, who should we stand behind?
:'''Welt:''' I don't think the followers of the Harmony are completely innocent victims in all of this. For reasons unknown, they have a strong desire to smooth things over, which leads to speculation about their motives.
:'''Welt:''' If either The Family or IPC were to assume full control of Penacony, it would return to its previous illusory dream of hedonism, and the efforts of those previous Nameless... would once again go to waste.
:'''Welt:''' There you are. Did you rest well?
:'''Dan Heng:''' I didn't disturb you since you were in a deep sleep.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It feels like I had a really long dream.
::'''Welt:''' Even long dreams eventually come to an end. Our adventure in Penacony is reaching its conclusion.
::Where is Himeko?
::'''Dan Heng:''' She went to negotiate with The Family as a representative of the Crew. She'll contact us once her arrangements are ready.
::Please continue the topic.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where is Himeko?
::'''Dan Heng:''' She went to negotiate with The Family as a representative of the Crew. She'll contact us once her arrangements are ready.
::Please continue the topic.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Please continue the topic.
:'''Welt:''' After Ena's dream was shattered, The Family branch from the Montour System soon arrived and swiftly took control of the situation. Most members of the Oak Family fell unconscious, but fortunately, their lives were not in danger.
:'''Dan Heng:''' The mastermind behind the plans was confirmed to be Gopher Wood, the previous Dreammaster, but by the time we arrived... {{Rubi|he|Crows}} was dead already.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And... what about Sunday?
::'''Dan Heng:''' He'll face a trial. As for further details... The Family would rather not disclose them.
::How did the guests react?
::'''Welt:''' Since The Family branch from the Montour System managed to quash the spread of rumors within a short period of time, the majority of guests were unaware of the situation, and their lives remained largely unaffected.
::What will happen to Penacony?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How did the guests react?
::'''Welt:''' Since The Family branch from the Montour System managed to quash the spread of rumors within a short period of time, the majority of guests were unaware of the situation, and their lives remained largely unaffected.
::What will happen to Penacony?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What will happen to Penacony?
:'''Welt:''' That's what we're about to witness on the Radiant Feldspar.
:'''March 7th:''' Ultimately, the public perceived the incident as an attack by evil forces targeting the Charmony Festival. They believe The Family failed to safeguard the sweet dream, significantly eroding their credibility in the process.
:'''March 7th:''' While quite different from the truth, this appears to be the outcome with the least impact...
:'''Siobhan:''' After all, you don't know who's awake and who's pretending to be asleep. While they'll open their eyes in the face of danger, once the danger subsides, they'll embrace the sweet dream again.
:'''Siobhan:''' Here's a toast, with three glasses of "Glory of the Trailblaze" to all of you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hello again.
::'''Siobhan:''' Yeah, it's good to see you all again, although we might be saying goodbye again after this reunion.
::How come you're here too?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How come you're here too?
:'''Siobhan:''' What are you talking about? This is my lounge.
:'''Siobhan:''' It's good to see you all again, although we might be saying goodbye again after this reunion.
:'''Siobhan:''' When will the Astral Express leave Penacony?
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Talk to Siobhan and prepare a drink{{subst:void|<!--103410401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=The Reverie (Dreamscape)|update|The story of Penacony has (nearly) drawn to a conclusion, and you can finally spend some of your free time with your friends.<br />The Crew members gather at Siobhan's establishment and get ready to mix a few drinks in memory of those who lost their lives &mdash; while also celebrating the promise of new life.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Siobhan)
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to Gallagher?
::'''Siobhan:''' I'm not sure. I haven't seen him since our last meeting at the lounge. Come to think of it, he always did come and go quietly.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's mix the drinks.
::'''Siobhan:''' Before we start, would you like to talk to your friends? We have plenty of time.
::Great idea. I'll come back soon.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} No need. Let's get started.
:::'''Siobhan:''' Alright, as you wish.
:::'''Siobhan:''' I think I have an idea about what drink to make. Would you like it bitter or sweet? It's up to you. Choose the flavor that suits you best at this moment.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Bitter.
::::'''Siobhan:''' Here's Bitter Dreams... the least popular drink in this bar. It's bitter and sour, just like the harsh realities of life.
::::{{tx}}
:::<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.SetMissionCustomValue",
	"SubmissionID": 103410401,
	"MissionCustomValue": {
		"Name": "OldValue_0",
		"ValidValueParamList": [
			1,
			2
		]
	},
	"CustomValue": 2
}</pre>
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sweet.
::::'''Siobhan:''' Drowning Sweetness... one of the most challenging drinks to make. A slight imbalance in the ingredients can result in an overwhelmingly viscous, sweet taste.
::::{{tx}}
:::<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.SetMissionCustomValue",
	"SubmissionID": 103410401,
	"MissionCustomValue": {
		"Name": "OldValue_0",
		"ValidValueParamList": [
			1,
			2
		]
	},
	"CustomValue": 1
}</pre>
::{{Диалог|Выход}} Great idea. I'll come back soon.
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Just a moment. I'd like to talk to everyone.
::'''Siobhan:''' Sure, we can wait – Gallagher included.
::{{tx}}

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' Guess what! Something weird just happened when I was on my way over here. Someone gave me a strange gift.
::'''March 7th:''' So I unwrapped it and found out it was a button, with a message on the back: "Just press this button, and all of Penacony will explode!" Sounds terrifying!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Could it be a terrorist attack!?
:::'''March 7th:''' But who would launch such an obvious attack? They just want to stir up chaos.
:::Did you press it?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did you press it?
::'''March 7th:''' Of course not! Who would press something like that!
::'''March 7th:''' By the time I turned around, the person had already vanished. So I handed it over to a nearby hound. I heard there were many similar reports before the Charmony Festival started.
::{{tx}}
:{{tx}}

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
;(All choices lead to the following options)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} But what about the Express?
::'''Dan Heng:''' Given the conductor's presence, there's no need to worry about it. However, it's crucial that we soon return to inform Pom-Pom about uh... the Nameless.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to you in Ena's dream?
::'''Dan Heng:''' In my dream, the Express stopped at many places, and passengers came and went. However, the five of us were always present, and the journey seemed never-ending.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Is the Order incident in Penacony a unique case...?
::'''Dan Heng:''' No related records exist in the data bank, but I have a theory: The hidden dangers of the Order have always been within the Harmony &mdash; And this issue existed within The Family from the very beginning.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} That's all for now.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Like I said, we'll go and see. Once we've packed everything, we should head to our next destination.
::{{tx}}

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}
;(All choices lead to the following options)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What will happen to Sunday and Robin?
::'''Welt:''' One bird longs for the earth, and the other longs for the sky... Even if Robin had to stop her brother with her own hands, she won't give up on him.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} When did the Order infiltrate Penacony?
::'''Welt:''' Since The Family took up residence in Penacony, the Order has been hiding in plain sight under the guise of the Oak Family, using the Stellaron's power to strengthen their hold on the sweet dream, which eventually resulted in disaster.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Did the IPC make any move?
::'''Welt:''' Aventurine's efforts finally earned the IPC a seat at the table. As a result, a more senior representative arrived in Penacony and initiated negotiations with The Family.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to you in Ena's dream?
::'''Welt:''' Well, it was somewhat surprising. In that dream, I returned to my homeworld and reunited with my long-lost friends. And for some reason... Acheron resurfaced in my mind.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Выход}} That's all for now.
::'''Welt:''' The conclusion of a journey can often be sorrowful. All we can do is try to make sure it ends on a happy note.
::{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

